        "created_at": "2012-09-28T16:36:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There was a little bit of worry and wiggling in there. We used penny sleeves; there was some crushing of the tops of the sleeves and the box is bowed out a bit but there's no damage to the cards whatsoever. We are planning to either mod the box by taking out the center divider and putting in something a little thinner, or buying one of the big multi-channel CCG boxes. (We discussed not using sleeves but I take my Sentinels cards to cons and don't want gerrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrms.)</p>",
